  "question": {
    "text": "If a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> has vertices&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then its orthocentre has coordinates:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
